@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy</PageTitle>

<article class="container py-4" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Effective August 25, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="h4">Mobile information</h2>
    <p>Charlie Company Ventures uses the mobile number and SMS consent information you provide to deliver account, job, estimate, scheduling, and operational messages that you request.</p>
    <p>We do not sell mobile phone numbers or SMS consent records. We do not share mobile information with third parties for their own marketing or promotional purposes. We may provide it to messaging, hosting, security, and support vendors only as needed to operate and protect the service.</p>

    <h2 class="h4">Consent records and choices</h2>
    <p>We retain records of SMS consent and revocation, including the phone number, time, source, and disclosure version, for compliance and audit purposes. You may opt out by replying STOP or by disabling text messaging in your profile.</p>

    <h2 class="h4">Security and support</h2>
    <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards, but no transmission or storage method is completely secure. Contact your Charlie Company Ventures administrator for privacy questions or account-data requests.</p>
</article>
